{"data":{"body":"[P2] Reject impossible calendar dates before parsing\n\nChecking for `NaN` does not validate calendar dates: Node accepts `2026-02-30` and rolls it forward to `2026-03-02`. Consequently, an invalid bound that Aurora previously rejected now silently queries a different date range. Validate the day against the supplied month and leap year before converting to UTC, and add rejection tests for February 30, February 29 in a non-leap year, and April 31.","comment_node_id":"PRRC_kwDOPenXVs8AAAABBBgakg","finding_digest":"6de4a96a57d77b901cecfa8ebb9f79eeac19b29da7a136199507982581b2f814","finding_id":"arf_v1_nxsks2sx255zahhm7khlxh3z52","finding_key":"telemetry-mcp/sqlsafe.ts::normalizetimestamp::calendar-overflow-acceptance","identity_key":"telemetry-mcp/sqlsafe.ts::normalizetimestamp::calendar-overflow-acceptance","line":143,"observation_digest":"78e43fff350ce5795bd9bb52f6ee31ad2d3ace87ac583f9c61fff529cbf57199","observation_id":"aro_v1_pdsd77zvbtsxsw6zxnjpn3rrvu","path":"packages/aws-durable-execution-sdk-js-telemetry-mcp/src/sqlSafe.ts","prior_finding_id":"","published_at":"2026-10-23T19:53:17Z","review_id":"arr_v1_zuc5pjbwdomwidmfuqpom2wwd4","reviewed_base_sha":"c0a7e3497f54fb451e13f54bd9b5604eedde771c","reviewed_head_sha":"66db9d277cdecaf20ab8ca836a892cf375819f1f","reviewer":"codex","start_line":142,"suggestion_id":""},"pull_request":{"number":1070},"record_id":"art_v1_3yzkd6vbeyeq7g7lfk6535ym5h","record_type":"finding_observed","recorded_at":"2026-10-23T19:53:17Z","repository":{"full_name":"aws/aws-durable-execution-sdk-js","id":1038735190},"schema_version":1}
